      "content": "This looks okay as a template, but I need more substance if we're going to convince them. They're going to ask for specifics. Can you provide a more detailed breakdown of exactly how these specific rotation patterns (the ones with the 12-hour gaps between shifts) meet the mandatory rest requirements? I need you to link the data from our scheduling logs to the specific safety clauses they're citing so it looks indisputable.",
